Step 1: Create GitHub Repo
bashGo to github.com → New Repository → Name it "react-hooks-lib"
Step 2: Clone & Setup
bashgit clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/react-hooks-lib.git
cd react-hooks-lib
npm install
Step 3: Create npm Account
Go to npmjs.com → Sign up → Create access token
Step 4: Build & Publish
bashnpm login
npm run build
npm publish --workspace=packages/core --access public
Step 5: Done! 🎉
Your package is now on npm!
Users can install with: npm install @YOUR_USERNAME/react-hooks-lib